### name: plan.own.range-error-at-an-intermediate-product
--- note
X has mantissa 1 and scale 100000, so each product adds 100000 fractional digits and the tenth `*` is the first past MAX_FRAC_DIGITS (spec §6.4): E_RANGE at that operator, wherever the host keeps the intermediate products.
--- setup
X = POWER(0.1, 100000)
--- source
X * X * X * X * X * X * X * X * X * X * X
--- expect
error E_RANGE at 1:39
===

